  "body": "Hi, \r\nI think it will be great if there a callback event for unsubscribe. So once use block notification access new event listener fired on service worker to inform the backend about user unsubscribe. This will give web push notification more power and It will be easy for publisher to track subscribers behaviors \r\nThanks. ",
